    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You gain access to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unleashed_Abilities\" title=\"Unleashed Abilities\">Unleashed Abilities</a>. If you have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat, you also gain access to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Abilities\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Unleashed Abilities\">Force Unleashed Abilities</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Have a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny\" title=\"Destiny\">Destiny</a>, Receive the Gamemaster's Approval</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can activate <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unleashed_Abilities\" title=\"Unleashed Abilities\">Unleashed Abilities</a> by spending a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Destiny_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Point\">Destiny Point</a>. You must also have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat in order to activate <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Abilities\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Unleashed Abilities\">Force Unleashed Abilities</a> for <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Talents\" title=\"Force Talents\">Force Talents</a>.</p>",
